<title>USA: Readington Twp, won by Ryan, Beck.</title>
<headline>Readington Twp, won by Ryan, Beck.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said it won $4.406 million of Readington Township, N.J., general improvement bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.31 percent.</p>
</text>
